## Key architecture choices

- Pre-send in **engine** (not Admin-only) so all future deliverers get I.4
- Terminal statuses as **local string frozenset** (no cognitive import)
- Admin permanent fail: `mark_failed` + `notify_info` + approval `cancelled` (not waiting)
- fake_delivery F1 = record-only success without actuator I/O
- FixedDelayPolicy remains 0-ok for tests; prod policy clamped

